## Layout

```
.
├── Pulumi.yaml
├── Pulumi.dev.yaml
├── Pulumi.prod.yaml
├── index.ts
├── config.ts
└── components/
    └── appPlatform.ts
```

---

## `Pulumi.yaml`

```yaml
name: app-platform
runtime:
  name: nodejs
  options:
    typescript: true
description: Bucket + RDS + IAM service account, packaged as a ComponentResource
```

